<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Changelog | RealtimeKit Web UI Addons</title><description>Updates to RealtimeKit Web UI Addons</description><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/realtime/realtimekit/release-notes/ui-kit-addons</link><item><title>RealtimeKit Web UI Addons - RealtimeKit Web UI Addons 0.2.0</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/realtime/realtimekit/release-notes/ui-kit-addons/#realtimekit-web-ui-addons-020</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/realtime/realtimekit/release-notes/ui-kit-addons/#realtimekit-web-ui-addons-020</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emoji reactions now display the participant&apos;s first name when available, making it easier to identify who reacted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The reaction picker background now uses UI Kit design tokens to match the configured theme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>RealtimeKit Web UI Addons - RealtimeKit Web UI Addons 0.1.0</title><link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/realtime/realtimekit/release-notes/ui-kit-addons/#realtimekit-web-ui-addons-010</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://developers.cloudflare.com/realtime/realtimekit/release-notes/ui-kit-addons/#realtimekit-web-ui-addons-010</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initial release of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.npmjs.com/package/@cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;@cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; package, with examples for extending RealtimeKit Web UI Kit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host controls: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/camera-host-control/&quot;&gt;Camera Host Control&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/mic-host-control/&quot;&gt;Mic Host Control&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/chat-host-control/&quot;&gt;Chat Host Control&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reactions: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/hand-raise/&quot;&gt;Hand Raise&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/reactions-manager/&quot;&gt;Reactions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participant customization: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/participant-tile-menu/&quot;&gt;Participant Tile Menu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/participant-menu-item/&quot;&gt;Participant Menu Item&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/participants-tab-action/&quot;&gt;Participants Tab Action&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/participants-tab-toggle/&quot;&gt;Participants Tab Toggle&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting appearance and controls: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/video-background/&quot;&gt;Video Background&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/realtimekit-ui-addons/blob/HEAD/src/custom-controlbar-button/&quot;&gt;Custom Control Bar Button&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/realtime/realtimekit/humans/ui-kit/addons/&quot;&gt;UI Kit Addons&lt;/a&gt; for installation and usage.&lt;/p&gt;
</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>